&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;import &lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;import asyncio
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;async def delivery&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;name, mealtime&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    print&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;f&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;{name}에게 배달 완료!&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    await asyncio.sleep&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;mealtime&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    print&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;f&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;{name} 식사 완료, {mealtime}시간 소요...&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    print&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;f&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;{name} 그릇 수거 완료&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;async def main&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    await asyncio.gather&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        delivery&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;A&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, 1&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        delivery&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;B&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, 1&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        delivery&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;C&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, 1&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# return None &amp;lt;- 생략 되어 있음&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;__name__&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;__main__&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;start&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; time.time&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    asyncio.run&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;main&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;())&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;end&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; time.time&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    print&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;end - start&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;A에게 배달 완료!
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;B에게 배달 완료!
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;C에게 배달 완료!
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;A 식사 완료, 1시간 소요...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;A 그릇 수거 완료
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;B 식사 완료, 1시간 소요...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;B 그릇 수거 완료
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;C 식사 완료, 1시간 소요...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;C 그릇 수거 완료
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;-&amp;gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;await asyncio.sleep(mealtime)에서 탈출을 하고
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;다시 await asyncio.sleep(mealtime)로 진입을 하게 됨
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;원래는 async def delivery(name, mealtime):로 진입했었음
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;즉, 진입점 2개, 탈출점이 2개가 있음
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;코루틴은 파이썬만 있는게 아니라 javascript, golang등 다양한 언어에서 지원&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;예시의 delivery()와 같은 함수를 코루틴 함수라고 함. 코루틴 함수로 비동기 코드를 작성할 수 있음&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;따라서, 파이썬 비동기 함수는 코루틴 함수로 작성할 수 있다고 볼 수 있음&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;간단하게 정리하자면&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;코루틴은 다양한 진입점과 다양한 탈출점이 있는 함수&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;서브루틴은 하나의 진입점과 하나의 탈출점이 있는 일반적인 함수&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;라고 생각할 수 있다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;코루틴의 장점&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;쓰레드에 비해 오버헤드 감소. 에시: 쓰레드는 컨텍스트 스위칭 비용 발생이 큼&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;코루틴은 단일(싱글) 스레드에서 스택을 기반으로 동작하는 비동기 작업. 단일 스레드내에서도 동시성 프로그래밍 할 수 있도록 발전&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;concurrency과-parallelism&#34;&gt;Concurrency과 Parallelism
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%EC%84%B1/13.png&#34;
	width=&#34;4169&#34;
	height=&#34;1913&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%EC%84%B1/13_hu12171274134025618073.png 480w, https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%EC%84%B1/13_hu15541461973087781464.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;I/O-bound 작업의 순차적 실행 vs 병렬 &amp;#43; 동시 실행&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;217&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;523px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%EC%84%B1/15.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2946&#34;
	height=&#34;789&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%EC%84%B1/15_hu15040346347333492723.png 480w, https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%EC%84%B1/15_hu14253826417657835942.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;순차적 작업 실행&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;373&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;896px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;빨간색 작업이 실행을 시작하려면 녹색 작업이 먼저 완료되어야 함. 채워진 각 원은 수행해야 할 명령&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;concurrency&#34;&gt;Concurrency
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;동시성은 여러 작업 또는 프로세스의 실행이 시간적으로 겹치는 것&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;시간적으로 겹치지만 둘 다 같은 순간에 실행되지 않을 수도 있음&lt;br&gt;
-&amp;gt; 반드시 물리적으로 동시에 즉, 병렬로 실행되지 않을 수 있음(작업 스위칭)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;parallelism&#34;&gt;Parallelism
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;병렬성은 여러 작업 또는 프로세스가 물리적으로 동시에 실행되는 것&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;∴ 동시성은 시간적으로 겹치는 작업을 포함하는 더 광범위한 개념&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%EC%84%B1/16.png&#34;
	width=&#34;1699&#34;
	height=&#34;1023&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%EC%84%B1/16_hu17283264528452195648.png 480w, https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%EC%84%B1/16_hu9805957252235036327.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;병렬(Parallel) 작업 실행&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;166&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;398px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;두 작업을 병렬로 실행하면 많은 시간을 절약&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;두 개의 프로세스, 스레드 또는 작업이 병렬로 실행되면 동시에 실행됨&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%EC%84%B1/17.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2946&#34;
	height=&#34;1023&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%EC%84%B1/17_hu8867914901714610308.png 480w, https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EB%8F%99%EC%8B%9C%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B3%91%EB%A0%AC%EC%84%B1/17_hu15279083045364910593.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;동시(Concurrent) 작업 실행&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;287&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;691px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;동시성에서 말하는 동시(Concurrent)&lt;br&gt;
병렬에서 말하는 동시(Simultaneous)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;concurrency-and-parallelism-scenarios&#34;&gt;Concurrency and Parallelism Scenarios
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;기본적으로 여러 작업을 병렬로 실행하려면 최소 두 개의 CPU 코어가 필요&lt;br&gt;
(동시 멀티스레딩(Simultaneous Multithreading, SMT) 또는 하이퍼스레딩(Hyper-Threading) 기술로 하나의 코어만으로 여러 작업을 병렬로 실행할 수 있지만 지금은 기본적인 내용으로)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1 process, 1 thread, 1 core&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ 동시성&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;❌ 멀티스레딩을 통한 동시성은 없음&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✅ 코루틴을 사용한 동시성&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1 process, n threads, 1 core&lt;br&gt;
✅ 동시성&lt;br&gt;
❌ 병렬 처리 없음(예외: 하이퍼 스레딩)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1 process, n threads, 2 cores&lt;br&gt;
✅ 동시성&lt;br&gt;
✅❌ 병렬 처리 여부는 프로그래밍 언어에 따라 달라짐&lt;br&gt;
(Python의 각 프로세스 내의 스레드는 Python의 GIL(Global Interpreter Lock)로 인해 실제로 병렬로 실행될 수 없음. Java, C/C++, Go 등 다른 프로그래밍 언어의 스레드와는 다름)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2 processes, n threads, 1 core&lt;br&gt;
✅ 동시성&lt;br&gt;
❌ 병렬 처리 없음(예외: 하이퍼 스레딩)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2 processes, n threads, 2 cores&lt;br&gt;
✅ 동시성&lt;br&gt;
✅ 병렬성, 두 프로세스는 병렬로 실행될 수 있음&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;advantages-and-disadvantages&#34;&gt;Advantages and Disadvantages
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;advantages&#34;&gt;Advantages
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;리소스의 보다 효율적인 할당과 그에 따른 시간 절약
cost-effective(비용 효율)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;스레드 컨텍스트 스위칭은 프로세스 컨텍스트 스위칭보다 비용 효율적&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;파이버(fibers)와 코루인(Coroutine)과 같이 컨텍스트 전환 비용을 최소화하는 메커니즘도 있음&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;코루틴은 스레드 컨텍스트 스위칭보다 비용 효율적&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;프로세스 컨텍스트 스위칭 cost &amp;gt; 스레드 컨텍스트 스위칭 cost &amp;gt; 코루틴 cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;disadvantages&#34;&gt;Disadvantages
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;복잡성 증가&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;동시성과 병렬성을 다룰 때 새로운 문제가 발생(예시: race conditions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;충돌을 피하기 위해 locking(잠금), semaphores(세마포어), optimistic concurrency control(낙관적 동시성 제어), transaction management(트랜잭션 관리)등
여러 기법을 사용해 공유 리소스를 신중히 관리&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;conclusion&#34;&gt;Conclusion
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;동시 프로그래밍은 고성능 시스템을 개발하는 데 도움이 되는 매우 강력한 도구이지만, 복잡성을 수반하기 때문에 심도 있게 연구해야 하는 주제&lt;/p&gt;
